        },
        {
          "text": "Sihoni umwami w’Abamori, yaba i Heshiboni, yatwara uhereye kuri Aroweri ho ku mucāmo hejuru y’ umwonga wo kuri Arunoni, ukajana uwo mwonga nyene, n’igihimba c’i Gileyadi, ugashitsa ku ruzi Yaboki, ari rwo rugabano rw’Abamoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.11.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 11:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bo n’ikiyaya Araba, ugashitsa ku kiyaga Kinereti ku ruhande rw’i burasirazuba, no ku kiyaga co mur’ ico kiyaya Araba nyene, ari co Kiyaga c’Umunyu, ku ruhande rw’i burasirazuba uko rugiye rurābana n’i Beti‐yeshimoti, ugaca i bumanuko, musi y’agahanamo ka Pisiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
