              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yatwara uhereye ku musozi Herumoni n’i Saleka n’i Bashani hose, gushitsa ku rugabano rw’Abageshuri n’Abanyamayaka, n’igihimba c’i Gileyadi gushitsa ku rugabano rwa Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
